    <node id="&quot;PHI DELTA GAMMA (SOCIAL)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Phi Delta Gamma (ΦΔΓ) of Puerto Rico is the first Puerto Rican organization of Greek letters, founded in the western town of Mayagüez, on April 25, 1942."</data>
