      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"College of Agriculture and Mechanic Arts (Colegio de Agricultura y Artes Mecánicas) is the institution where some members of Alpha Iota Omega enrolled and founded Phi Delta Gamma (ΦΔΓ) of Puerto Rico."</data>
